### Must-fix (ranked)

1. **MF-1 (high)** Phase-7 `K_d`/control slicing: F/L `h_len` up to 830 > `K_M=753`, so `M_POS_MEAN[:K_d]` is out of range. Define `K_d = min(K_M, len(real), len(donor))` and truncate prefixes to `K_M`.
2. **MF-2 (high)** Bind `baseline_ce` to the variant-selected control CE **at `K_d`**, not the phase-5 `K_M` baseline.
